                                                "text": "Tryuyals, & quatryuyals, ſo ſore now they appayre\nThat Parrot the Popagay, hath pytye to beholde\nHow the reſt of good lernyng, is roufled vp & trold"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ab0a058-9b15-4748-8c29-f1fd7e12764b",
                                                "sense_id": "3ee0b91c-45c6-3ab2-8032-1aec9e56184b",
                                                "text": "St. Edmund was bred in this University in the Trivials and Quadrivials till he was Professor of Arts"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
